  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'><p>Reach modern heights with early 2000s running style in the NIKE Zoom Vomero 5. These kicks blend leather and suede overlays for a crafted feel on an unmistakable activewear silhouette. Equipped with responsive Air Zoom cushioning and a foam midsole, these sneakers ensure you stay quick and comfortable on your feet with every stride.<br><ul><li>Leather and suede upper provides a durable and premium look</li><li>Plastic side caging adds essential support and stability</li><li>Air Zoom cushioning delivers a responsive quick-off-the-ground feel</li><li>Foam midsole offers lightweight comfort for all-day wear</li><li>Rubber outsole with lugged soles ensures durable traction</li></ul><br><b>Material & Care</b><br><ul><li>Leather, suede, and synthetic upper</li><li>Rubber outsole</li></ul></p></div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike Zoom Vomero 5 SE LOS SD - Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>College Grey/Med Ash/Cave Stone</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Width</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Width - D - Medium</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Material</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Breathable mesh upper with durable synthetic overlays and rubber traction outsole</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>IV6857-002</td></tr><tr><t